@crew ithra
// Writer (command: guests), batch 3b. Ithra: a word or two, then a nod.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Good day.
- Hm. You. New. Good.
? tier>=acquaintance
- {me}. Good day. Doors are shut. Good.
== feel
? mood:high
- Good run. Good doors.
? mood:low
- Long day. Many doors.
== near
? time:morning
- Running. Plaza. Every dawn. Join, if you keep up.   #funny
? deck:2
- Your Chief Holt watches this corridor. So do I. We nod.   #funny
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I fly the shuttle. I watch the doors. That is all. It is enough.
